{"summary":"Restore correct hexadecimal digit conversion","explanation":"The regression changes the alphabetic hex digit offset from 9 to 8. Hex digits A–F must map to 10–15; restoring the offset fixes the reported escape and unescape failures.","edits":[{"path":"absl/strings/escaping.cc","old":"  if (x > '9') {
    x += 8;
  }","new":"  if (x > '9') {
    x += 9;
  }"}]}
